          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-346",
          "body_paragraph": 2,
          "locator": "div#letter div.body-content; retained body block 2",
          "quote": "You tell me you do not see what is new in Sir J. Herschell’s idea about the chronology of the old Testament being wrong.",
