      "rationale": "Darwin acknowledges receipt and answers the distinctive discussion of Caroline Tollet's reading, Emma's already having read Nicholas Nickleby, and her wavering over suburban versus central housing. These occur in 444, not the initially selected 441.",
      "evidence": [
        {
