      "rationale": "Kemp accepts disappointing doubts about the seed discovery graciously. Darwin explicitly praises the tone of his last letter in that disappointment and reopens the publication question; editorial notes identify 711.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "letter_id": "DCP-LETT-711",
          "body_paragraph": 3,
          "locator": "div#letter div.body-content; retained body block 3",
          "quote": "As for my part, it matters nothing, the investigation has given a pleasure that amply repays any trouble in the concern.",
          "char_start": 99,
          "source": {
            "path": "data/raw/dcp/expansion-1837-1843-pilot/DCP-LETT-711.html",
            "url": "https://www.darwinproject.ac.uk/letter/?docId=letters/DCP-LETT-711.xml",
            "retrieved_at": "2026-09-16T09:24:49.769542+00:00",
